{"sections":{"breadcrumbs":{"type":"breadcrumbs","settings":{"text_alignment":"start"}},"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"badges":{"type":"badges","settings":{"show_soldout_badge":true,"show_sale_badge":true,"sale_badge_type":"percentage"}},"title":{"type":"title","settings":{"heading_size":"h6"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"description":{"type":"description","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"inventory":{"type":"inventory","settings":{"text_style":"body","inventory_threshold":20,"show_inventory_quantity":true}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Description","icon":"none","content":"<h2><strong>Upgrade your stroller experience with the Magnetic stroller phone holder - flexibility and stability<\/strong><\/h2><p>Designed for busy modern parents, the Lumipia Stroller Phone Holder combines MagSafe technology, a universal clip, and a rugged design to ensure your phone is securely and easily accessible on every trip. With replaceable magnetic heads and durable construction, it is the perfect companion for your daily vlogging, navigation, or hands-free use while pushing the stroller.<\/p><h2><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/h2><p>Interchangeable Holders: Magnetic and Clip-OnThe Stroller Phone Holder easily switches between the 52N magnetic head for MagSafe-compatible iPhones and the universal phone clip, giving you the flexibility to securely hold any smartphone while taking a stroll or shooting a vlog.<\/p><h2><strong>MagSafe Compatible, Seamless Connection<\/strong><\/h2><p>Designed for iPhone 12-16 series and MagSafe cases, the magnetic mount provides a quick and stable clip-on installation experience, perfect for on-the-go use.<\/p><h2>Fits most strollers and installs in seconds<\/h2><p>The crab-shaped clip provides a strong grip and attaches securely to a variety of stroller bars without tools, even on uneven surfaces.<\/p><h2>Adjustable viewing angle<\/h2><p>The stroller phone holder smoothly tilts and swivels your phone to get the perfect shot, track GPS or make video calls - completely hands-free.<\/p><h2>Durable and lightweight design<\/h2><p>Made of high-strength plastic, this stroller phone holder weighs only 0.3 kg and measures 16.5 × 15.5 × 8.5 cm. Small and portable, it won't get in your way, but it's strong enough for everyday use.<\/p><p>From early morning walks to weekend adventures, the Lumipia stroller phone holder keeps your phone safe, visible and ready to go. Upgrade your stroller today - parenting shouldn't mean being offline.<\/p>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","default_open":false}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Size","icon":"none","content":"<ul><li>Product size: 16.5*15.5*8.5cm<\/li><li>Product weight: 0.3kg<\/li><\/ul>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","default_open":false}},"collapsible-row-3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"What's Included","icon":"none","content":"<ul><li>Crab claw*1<\/li><li>Magnetic phone holder*1<\/li><li>Neutral phone holder*1<\/li><li>Sticker*1<\/li><li>Kraft paper box*1<\/li><li>QR code sticker<\/li><\/ul>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","default_open":false}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button","swatch_type":"color_swatch","button_style":"standard","button_size":40,"size_title":"Size","size_chart_from_page":""}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_quantity_selector":true,"show_dynamic_checkout":true,"show_gift_card_recipient":true}},"custom_liquid_kYpRtb":{"type":"custom_liquid","settings":{"custom_liquid":"<div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px 0;\">\n  <h2 style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    Trusted by Real Creators Like You ⭐\n  <\/h2>\n  <img \n    src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0598\/1044\/7462\/files\/20250616-140009.jpg?v=1750053644\" \n    alt=\"LUMIPIA Trustpilot Rating\" \n    style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: inline-block;\" \n  \/>\n<\/div